"disable overclock if it's enabled."
msgstr ""
"Temperaturen på systemet ditt er høy.\n"
"Systemet kan bli tregere. Prøv å kjøle ned Raspberry Pi-en med en vifte "
"eller deaktiver overklokking hvis den er aktivert."

msgid ""
"Choose strategy\n"
"\n"
"AUTO: auto apply default patch\n"
"\n"
"LAUNCH LAST: always launch the last one (can be modified in edit game menu)\n"
"\n"
"SELECT: choose manually which patch to apply. Default one or patches in "
"[ROM_NAME]-patches directory\n"
"\n"
"DISABLED: never apply patch"
msgstr ""
"Velg strategi\n"
"\n"
"AUTO: bruker automatisk standardpatchen\n"
"\n"
"START SISTE: starter alltid den sist brukte (kan endres i rediger spill-"
"menyen)\n"
"\n"
"VELG: velg manuelt hvilken patch som skal brukes. Standard eller patcher i "
"mappen [ROM_NAME]-patches\n"
"\n"
"DEAKTIVERT: bruk aldri patch"

msgid "Set the Super GameBoy mode for GameBoy games."
msgstr "Angi Super GameBoy-modus for GameBoy-spill."

msgid ""
"Improves resolution on compatible 3d emulators. May have an impact on "
"performance. (Dreamcast, Naomi, Atomiswave, Playstation, Saturn)"
msgstr ""
"Forbedrer oppløsningen på kompatible 3D-emulatorer. Kan påvirke ytelsen. "
"(Dreamcast, Naomi, Atomiswave, Playstation, Saturn)"

msgid ""
"Enables 16:9 hacks for compatible emulators. May have an impact on "
"performance. (Dreamcast, Naomi, Atomiswave, Snes, Megadrive)"
msgstr ""
"Aktiverer 16:9-hack for kompatible emulatorer. Kan påvirke ytelsen. "
"(Dreamcast, Naomi, Atomiswave, Snes, Megadrive)"

